# GludioHold's static-object clan-attacked hook on a siege summon's hit: the character's
# Siege Golem (a fixture siege summon of 14737, on a siege battlefield in progress) hits a
# gate (Gludio's outer gate's id, 19210001), and the knight of Gludio Castle (35066,
# GludioKnight, of door_clan) by it draws: under 10 it wants to attack the golem's owner with
# weight 5000, otherwise the golem itself with weight 1000.
character Hunter 20
random 9 10
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
door gate 19210001 100 0 0
npc knight 35066 SiegeGuard 100 200 0 walks clan door_clan 300
summon golem 14737

hit gate 100 by golem
  hate knight 5000
  hate knight 0 golem
  desires knight attack(player)=5000

hit gate 100 by golem
  hate knight 5000
  hate knight 1000 golem
  desires knight attack(player)=5000 attack(golem)=1000
